{
  "project_id": 21,
  "project_label": "gemma",
  "task_id": 8400,
  "title": "Different ways of knowing",
  "author": "Daniel Tammet",
  "url": "https://www.ted.com/talks/daniel_tammet_different_ways_of_knowing",
  "annotation_id": null,
  "completed_by": 7,
  "created_at": "2026-05-07T06:56:37.205436Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-05-07T06:56:37.205436Z",
  "lead_time": 70.975,
  "result": [
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 6,
        "endOffset": 12,
        "text": "savant",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D32EFE3DBE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 68,
        "text": "I'm a savant, or more precisely, a high-functioning autistic savant.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C8030B449E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 22,
        "text": "It's a rare condition.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6B6F09B150",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 93,
        "text": "And rarer still when accompanied, as in my case, by self-awareness and a mastery of language.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6BE3FDC7FE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 99,
        "text": "Very often when I meet someone and they learn this about me, there's a certain kind of awkwardness.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4121D67FA1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 27,
        "text": "I can see it in their eyes.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5477762F35",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 30,
        "text": "They want to ask me something.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F96790115B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 88,
        "endOffset": 171,
        "text": "If I give you my date of birth, can you tell me what day of the week I was born on?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DB24FAE97B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "(Laughter)",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "79601DB188",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 88,
        "text": "I hope you'll forgive me if I don't perform a kind of one-man savant show for you today.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "057B0EA75E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 156,
        "text": "I'm going to talk instead about something far more interesting than dates of birth or cube roots -- a little deeper and a lot closer, to my mind, than work.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "20A52EFA22",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 47,
        "text": "I want to talk to you briefly about perception.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9D24C40DC3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 221,
        "text": "When he was writing the plays and the short stories that would make his name, Anton Chekhov kept a notebook in which he noted down his observations of the world around him -- little details that other people seem to miss.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2BDF9EA543",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 105,
        "text": "Every time I read Chekhov and his unique vision of human life, I'm reminded of why I too became a writer.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8F7E72FD4F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 138,
        "text": "In my books, I explore the nature of perception and how different kinds of perceiving create different kinds of knowing and understanding.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DBFAC899B0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 44,
        "text": "Here are three questions drawn from my work.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "24DAFF7B71",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 36,
        "endOffset": 81,
        "text": "I'm going to ask you to consider for a moment",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9D2C474A05",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 53,
        "endOffset": 56,
        "text": "you",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CC9867BE0E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 142,
        "endOffset": 166,
        "text": "your head and your heart",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CFE1BB2304",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 187,
        "text": "Rather than try to figure them out, I'm going to ask you to consider for a moment the intuitions and the gut instincts that are going through your head and your heart as you look at them.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1D93EF5EB0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 30,
        "endOffset": 42,
        "text": "can you feel",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DBC13EC725",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 99,
        "text": "For example, the calculation: can you feel where on the number line the solution is likely to fall?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B4A3E408F0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 44,
        "endOffset": 55,
        "text": "can you get",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AA49CE7E02",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 120,
        "text": "Or look at the foreign word and the sounds: can you get a sense of the range of meanings that it's pointing you towards?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8A5AD2CE21",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 91,
        "text": "And in terms of the line of poetry, why does the poet use the word hare rather than rabbit?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D979EB243A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 70,
        "endOffset": 77,
        "text": "you see",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "07EFAA693C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 11,
        "endOffset": 14,
        "text": "you",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2553762872",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 124,
        "text": "I'm asking you to do this because I believe our personal perceptions, you see, are at the heart of how we acquire knowledge.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E7669AF116",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 123,
        "text": "Aesthetic judgments, rather than abstract reasoning, guide and shape the process by which we all come to know what we know.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "08744BF920",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 31,
        "text": "I'm an extreme example of this.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CB00637450",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 31,
        "endOffset": 71,
        "text": "blur with color, emotion and personality",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6A739C8E1F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 72,
        "text": "My worlds of words and numbers blur with color, emotion and personality.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CB8486FF63",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 108,
        "text": "As Juan said, it's the condition that scientists call synesthesia, an unusual cross-talk between the senses.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "98C9D2EBAA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 94,
        "text": "Here are the numbers one to 12 as I see them -- every number with its own shape and character.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "13D29501CA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 9,
        "endOffset": 29,
        "text": "flash of white light",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D8B04D1A9F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 30,
        "text": "One is a flash of white light.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0E5B667D55",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 9,
        "endOffset": 37,
        "text": "tiny and very sad black hole",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4F8EDE6D08",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 38,
        "text": "Six is a tiny and very sad black hole.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "413E1C71E3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 74,
        "text": "The sketches are in black and white here, but in my mind they have colors.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AC03C8571B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 15,
        "text": "Three is green.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "840074ECDE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 13,
        "text": "Four is blue.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DBFE25CC84",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 14,
        "text": "Five is yellow",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "855C2BA31C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 16,
        "text": "I paint as well.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "840A10C3FF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 32,
        "text": "And here is one of my paintings.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AF5B937217",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 43,
        "text": "It's a multiplication of two prime numbers.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "96C8B0DD2E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "34",
        "end": "34",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 108,
        "text": "Three-dimensional shapes and the space they create in the middle creates a new shape, the answer to the sum.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CF0EF152AD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "35",
        "end": "35",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 26,
        "text": "What about bigger numbers?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DFFE200C2A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "36",
        "end": "36",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 66,
        "text": "Well you can't get much bigger than Pi, the mathematical constant.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F871A0A8EA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "37",
        "end": "37",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 53,
        "text": "It's an infinite number -- literally goes on forever.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "931316A6B5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "38",
        "end": "38",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 185,
        "text": "In this painting that I made of the first 20 decimals of Pi, I take the colors and the emotions and the textures and I pull them all together into a kind of rolling numerical landscape.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "24F66E2D3B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "39",
        "end": "39",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 47,
        "text": "But it's not only numbers that I see in colors.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BF259D21FE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "40",
        "end": "40",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 57,
        "text": "Words too, for me, have colors and emotions and textures.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BC1474B9E3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "41",
        "end": "41",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 54,
        "text": "And this is an opening phrase from the novel \"Lolita.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "93DBC326C3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "42",
        "end": "42",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 36,
        "text": "And Nabokov was himself synesthetic.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CBEB5468F5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "43",
        "end": "43",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 95,
        "text": "And you can see here how my perception of the sound L helps the alliteration to jump right out.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6BACB4C988",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "44",
        "end": "44",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 48,
        "text": "Another example: a little bit more mathematical.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A3A15C2BAA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 39,
        "text": "And I wonder if some of you will notice",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "11AE1D532C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 97,
        "text": "And I wonder if some of you will notice the construction of the sentence from \"The Great Gatsby.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B4EC9D6154",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "46",
        "end": "46",
        "startOffset": 9,
        "endOffset": 88,
        "text": "a procession of syllables -- wheat, one; prairies, two; lost Swede towns, three",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A8DF098734",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "46",
        "end": "46",
        "startOffset": 92,
        "endOffset": 107,
        "text": "one, two, three",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5F2BE15765",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "46",
        "end": "46",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 108,
        "text": "There is a procession of syllables -- wheat, one; prairies, two; lost Swede towns, three -- one, two, three.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D107C4DCE5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "47",
        "end": "47",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 86,
        "text": "And this effect is very pleasant on the mind, and it helps the sentence to feel right.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "899F9F814D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "48",
        "end": "48",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 42,
        "text": "Let's go back to the questions I posed you",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9312DAC6C2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "48",
        "end": "48",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 77,
        "text": "Let's go back to the questions I posed you a moment ago. 64 multiplied by 75.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E3DC6E62C2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "49",
        "end": "49",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 38,
        "text": "If some of you play chess, you'll know",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F84DBCECE0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "49",
        "end": "49",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 127,
        "text": "If some of you play chess, you'll know that 64 is a square number, and that's why chessboards, eight by eight, have 64 squares.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "20CD9C5AFB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "50",
        "end": "50",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 66,
        "text": "So that gives us a form that we can picture, that we can perceive.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A6F1CA91CD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "51",
        "end": "51",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 14,
        "text": "What about 75?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "45F9E561E9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "52",
        "end": "52",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 80,
        "text": "Well if 100, if we think of 100 as being like a square, 75 would look like this.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3C12675BF1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "53",
        "end": "53",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 114,
        "text": "So what we need to do now is put those two pictures together in our mind -- something like this. 64 becomes 6,400.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BBDB2321E5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "54",
        "end": "54",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 67,
        "text": "And in the right-hand corner, you don't have to calculate anything.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BC0E3BBC0F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "55",
        "end": "55",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 41,
        "text": "Four across, four up and down -- it's 16.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D4E3525CC2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "56",
        "end": "56",
        "startOffset": 48,
        "endOffset": 58,
        "text": "16, 16, 16",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5E5566BACA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "56",
        "end": "56",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 59,
        "text": "So what the sum is actually asking you to do is 16, 16, 16.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FD0EAE62A8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "57",
        "end": "57",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 81,
        "text": "That's a lot easier than the way that the school taught you to do math, I'm sure.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8577929FF9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "58",
        "end": "58",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 59,
        "text": "It's 16, 16, 16, 48, 4,800 -- 4,800, the answer to the sum.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3E9805D7CA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "59",
        "end": "59",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 23,
        "text": "Easy when you know how.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "14E1A42474",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "60",
        "end": "60",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 53,
        "text": "(Laughter) The second question was an Icelandic word.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "085B94C4FF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "61",
        "end": "61",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 64,
        "text": "I'm assuming there are not many people here who speak Icelandic.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "81BCE05C92",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "62",
        "end": "62",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 41,
        "text": "So let me narrow the choices down to two.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "98E5AA7C21",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "63",
        "end": "63",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 44,
        "text": "Hnugginn: is it a happy word, or a sad word?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FA9CA8B924",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "64",
        "end": "64",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 16,
        "text": "What do you say?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4983EAA578",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "65",
        "end": "65",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 5,
        "text": "Okay.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DEA68371D7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "66",
        "end": "66",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 27,
        "text": "Some people say it's happy.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D7BC0D6D60",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "67",
        "end": "67",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 43,
        "text": "Most people, a majority of people, say sad.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "726B7DD8AF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "68",
        "end": "68",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 26,
        "text": "And it actually means sad.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1DC12CD0F6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "69",
        "end": "69",
        "startOffset": 11,
        "endOffset": 114,
        "text": "Why do, statistically, a majority of people say that a word is sad, in this case, heavy in other cases?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C992F27A6D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "70",
        "end": "70",
        "startOffset": 14,
        "endOffset": 153,
        "text": "language evolves in such a way that sounds match, correspond with, the subjective, with the personal, intuitive experience of the listener.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1E470C6B53",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "71",
        "end": "71",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 40,
        "text": "Let's have a look at the third question.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "599A5C1B8A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "72",
        "end": "72",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 38,
        "text": "It's a line from a poem by John Keats.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "789B6429E6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "73",
        "end": "73",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 119,
        "text": "Words, like numbers, express fundamental relationships between objects and events and forces that constitute our world.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DBDD95E781",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "74",
        "end": "74",
        "startOffset": 25,
        "endOffset": 126,
        "text": "we, existing in this world, should in the course of our lives absorb intuitively those relationships.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4950B777AF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "75",
        "end": "75",
        "startOffset": 11,
        "endOffset": 29,
        "text": "like other artists",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8540C25A35",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "75",
        "end": "75",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 72,
        "text": "And poets, like other artists, play with those intuitive understandings.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9319796039",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "76",
        "end": "76",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 56,
        "text": "In the case of hare, it's an ambiguous sound in English.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "44B26BDD37",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "77",
        "end": "77",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 50,
        "text": "It can also mean the fibers that grow from a head.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E791CE1899",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "78",
        "end": "78",
        "startOffset": 56,
        "endOffset": 90,
        "text": "the fibers represent vulnerability",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "941FF49AEF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "78",
        "end": "78",
        "startOffset": 27,
        "endOffset": 52,
        "text": "let me put the picture up",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "077BFA525C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "78",
        "end": "78",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 91,
        "text": "And if we think of that -- let me put the picture up -- the fibers represent vulnerability.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D78BBE1312",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "79",
        "end": "79",
        "startOffset": 28,
        "endOffset": 57,
        "text": "movement or motion or emotion",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "91009363FD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "79",
        "end": "79",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 58,
        "text": "They yield to the slightest movement or motion or emotion.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8476D4EDC1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "80",
        "end": "80",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 63,
        "text": "So what you have is an atmosphere of vulnerability and tension.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7504C74709",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "81",
        "end": "81",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 74,
        "text": "The hare itself, the animal -- not a cat, not a dog, a hare -- why a hare?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1E87F5E4AE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "82",
        "end": "82",
        "startOffset": 8,
        "endOffset": 28,
        "text": "think of the picture",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "96B976491A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "82",
        "end": "82",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 58,
        "text": "Because think of the picture -- not the word, the picture.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "23C0AE189D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "83",
        "end": "83",
        "startOffset": 39,
        "endOffset": 79,
        "text": "helps us to picture, to feel intuitively",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2ECD9E7E1B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "83",
        "end": "83",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 118,
        "text": "The overlong ears, the overlarge feet, helps us to picture, to feel intuitively, what it means to limp and to tremble.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "575A5FAF81",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "84",
        "end": "84",
        "startOffset": 25,
        "endOffset": 55,
        "text": "I hope I've been able to share",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CEABE286BD",
      "from_name": "label",
